Description: Estimates multiple related Gaussian graphical models (one
    precision matrix per group) with the Bayesian joint spike-and-slab
    graphical lasso of Li, McCormick and Clark (2019) <doi:10.48550/arXiv.1805.07051>.
    An EM algorithm with spike-and-slab Laplace priors turns the fused or
    group graphical lasso into an edge-adaptive penalty, explored along a
    ladder of spike variances, and returns posterior edge inclusion
    probabilities. Also provides missing-data imputation, permutation and
    bootstrap tests for differential edges, cross-validation, and
    evaluation tools.
